      "widgets_values": [
        "1. Set your key in **ComfyUI menu → Extensions → OpenRouter → OpenRouter settings**.\n2. Describe the product shot in **Product Brief**.\n3. Press **Run**. The video is saved under `video/openrouter`."
      ],
      "title": "Start Here"
    },
