      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "**First Frame** draws a 16:9 still. **Write Camera Moves** looks at it and answers with three camera moves as JSON. Jev picks the one that suits a six-second teaser in **Best Move**, and **Animate** turns the still into video with that move.\n\nVideo is the costly step and is billed per second; check the price in **OpenRouter models** first. If you cancel, the job keeps running and is billed; collect it with the **Video: Collect a Video** workflow.\n\nFour paid requests per run. Prices are in **OpenRouter models**; each request's charge is at openrouter.ai/activity."
      ],
      "title": "Using This Workflow"
    },
